# Execution-Service Package Structure (Post-Hygiene)

RULE: Do not re-introduce deleted packages or resurrect the old module locations in execution-service.
WHY: Package hygiene refactor (execution_service_package_hygiene.plan.md) removed dead packages and collapsed single-file directories. Re-introducing them creates confusion and import path drift.
CODEX: execution_service_package_hygiene.plan.md (all todos completed 2026-03-06)

